## Import

In Terraform v1.5.0 and later, use an [`import` block](https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/language/import)
to import a role by its UID:

```terraform
import {
  to = spectrocloud_role.example
  id = "{roleUID}"
}
```

Using `terraform import`, import a role by its UID:

```console
terraform import spectrocloud_role.example {roleUID}
```

